# =========================================================
# AI Agent Exclusions (.kilocodeignore and .ignore)
# =========================================================

# 1. Dependency Lockfiles
# These are tracked in Git for reproducibility, but are thousands 
# of lines of dense JSON/TOML that will instantly drain your token budget.
uv.lock
poetry.lock
Pipfile.lock
package-lock.json
pnpm-lock.yaml

# 2. Jupyter Notebooks
# Tracked notebooks are saved as raw JSON containing verbose metadata 
# and base64-encoded images. Use Marimo or .py scripts for AI coding.
*.ipynb

# 3. Tracked Data & Configuration
# Prevents the AI from trying to read sample datasets or heavy configs
*.csv
*.tsv
*.jsonl
*.parquet
*.arrow
*.h5
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# 4. Model Weights
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.ckpt

# 5. Tracked Media & Assets
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.svg
*.ico
*.mp4
*.wav

# 6. Specific Overrides from .gitignore
data/attention_is_all_you_need.pdf